      "content": "I hear you, but it feels like you're saying the \"scientific\" side is basically settled and anyone who thinks sex and gender are the same is just wrong. Is there actually any legitimate scientific debate about whether gender is just a social construct vs a biological reality, or is the science just considered \"settled\" on this now?",
